      "versionNonce": 308986148,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785229070564,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x [B, S, H] \n\nx [B*S, H]\n\n@ router [H, E]\n\nrouter logits [B*S, E]\n\n按行求softmax并取top_k\n\n取top_k后的结果可以再softmax一次令概率和为1（可选）\n\ntopk_idx [B*S, K]\ntopk_idx [B*S, K]\n\n分发到各个expert后 [T, H] T为分发到这个expert的token数，T求和是B*S*K，即总任务数\n\n过激活和SiLU\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x [B, S, H] \n\nx [B*S, H]\n\n@ router [H, E]\n\nrouter logits [B*S, E]\n\n按行求softmax并取top_k\n\n取top_k后的结果可以再softmax一次令概率和为1（可选）\n\ntopk_idx [B*S, K]\ntopk_idx [B*S, K]\n\n分发到各个expert后 [T, H] T为分发到这个expert的token数，T求和是B*S*K，即总任务数\n\n过激活和SiLU\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
