      "updated": 1785565358872,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E = 8 8个专家\nR = EP = 4 4个rank\nE / R = 2 每个rank的专家 \nH = 4\nS = 2 每个rank初始有2个token，主要观察rank0上的2个token token0和token1\nK = 4 一个token发往4个expert\nNvS = S*K + (padding - 1) * 2 * E/R 当前令padding = 1，则 NvS = 8\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "E = 8 8个专家\nR = EP = 4 4个rank\nE / R = 2 每个rank的专家 \nH = 4\nS = 2 每个rank初始有2个token，主要观察rank0上的2个token token0和token1\nK = 4 一个token发往4个expert\nNvS = S*K + (padding - 1) * 2 * E/R 当前令padding = 1，则 NvS = 8\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
